        <briefdescription>
<para>Parse a JSON response from the LLM into a <ref refid="structthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_deontic_extraction" kindref="compound">DeonticExtraction</ref>. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Expected JSON format: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;deontic_category&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">:<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;obligation&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;confidence&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">:<sp/>0.92,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;entities&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">:<sp/>[</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>{</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;type&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">:<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;person_role&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;value&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">:<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;Betreiber&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">},</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>{</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;type&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">:<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;law_reference&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;value&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">:<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;§<sp/>4<sp/>Abs.<sp/>1&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>],</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;obligations&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">:<sp/>[</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>{</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;actor&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">:<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;Betreiber&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;action&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">:<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;Genehmigung<sp/>einholen&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;condition&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">:<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>llm_response</parametername>
